 in subcapital fracture of the femur. JBJS[Br] 53:183&#x02013;197 </citation></ref><ref id="CR11"><label>11.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bray</surname><given-names>TJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Femoral neck fracture fixation. Clinical decision making</article-title><source>Clin Orthop</source><year>1997</year><volume>339</volume><fpage>20</fpage><lpage>31</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1097/00003086-199706000-00004</pub-id></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Bray TJ (1997) Femoral neck fracture fixation. Clinical decision making. Clin Orthop 339:20&#x02013;31 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9186197</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR12"><label>12.</label><citation citation-type="other">Baumgartner MR, Higgins TF. In: Rockwood and greens. Fracture of the adults, vol P. Williams and Wilkins, pp 1579&#x02013;1634 </citation></ref><ref id="CR13"><label>13.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Meyers</surname><given-names>MH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The role of posterior bone grafts in failed neck fractures</article-title><source>Clin Orthop</source><year>1980</year><volume>150</volume><fpage>143</fpage><lpage>46</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Meyers MH (1980) The role of posterior bone grafts in failed neck fractures. Clin Orthop 150:143&#x02013;146 <pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7002405</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="CR14"><label>14.</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Marti</surname><given-names>RK</given-names></name><name><surname>Schuller</surname><given-names>HM</given-names></name><name><surname>Raaymakers</surname><given-names>EL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Intertrochanteric osteotomy for non union of the femoral neck</article-title><source>JBJS</source><year>1989</year><volume>71-b</volume><fpage>782</fpage><lpage>789</lpage></citation><citation citation-type="display-unstructured">Marti RK, Schuller HM, Raaymakers EL (1989) Intertrochanteric osteotomy for non union of the femoral neck. JBJS 71-b:782&#x02013;789 </citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>